{
  "key": 54295,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0488_T06R0301_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m the Chairman of the\n",
        "Pokémon Fan Club.\r",
        "I’ve raised over 150 Pokémon.\r",
        "I’m very fussy when it comes\n",
        "to Pokémon.\r",
        "Did you visit just to hear about\n",
        "my Pokémon? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0488_T06R0301_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "Good! Then listen up!\r",
        "So...my precious Rapidash...\r",
        "It’s...cute...lovely...smart...\n",
        "adorable...irresistible...plus...\f",
        "amazing... Don’t you think so?\f",
        "Oh, so...wild...beautiful...\f",
        "kind... I love it!\r",
        "Hug it... It’s warm and cuddly...\n",
        "Oh, it’s...spectacular...captivating...\f",
        "simply divine... I treasure it...\f",
        "Oops! Look at the time! I’ve kept\f",
        "you too long!\r",
        "Thanks for hearing me out. I want to\n",
        "give you this present!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0488_T06R0301_00002",
      "garbage": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0488_T06R0301_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "It’s a Rare Candy that makes\n",
        "Pokémon stronger.\r",
        "I prefer making my Pokémon stronger\n",
        "by battling, so you can have it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0488_T06R0301_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "Hello, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r",
        "Did you come see me about my\n",
        "Pokémon again?\r",
        "No? Oh... I had more tales to tell..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0488_T06R0301_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "Hello, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r",
        "Did you come see me about my\n",
        "Pokémon again?\r",
        "No? Oh... I had more tales to tell..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0488_T06R0301_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "How disappointing...\r",
        "Come back if you want to listen\n",
        "to me again!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0488_T06R0301_00007",
      "en_US": "Your Bag is jammed full."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0488_T06R0301_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "Our Chairman is very vocal when it\n",
        "comes to Pokémon..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0488_T06R0301_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "I love the way Clefairy opens up\n",
        "its arms!\r",
        "It’s so adorable!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0488_T06R0301_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "I love Clefairy, but I could never\n",
        "catch one.\r",
        "So I’m making do with a Poké Doll\n",
        "that I found."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0488_T06R0301_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "I love Clefairy, but I could never\n",
        "catch one. So I’m making do with a\f",
        "Poké Doll that I found.\r",
        "What?\n",
        "The girl who lost this Poké Doll\f",
        "is sad...!\r",
        "OK. Could you take this Poké Doll\n",
        "back to that poor little girl?\r",
        "I’ll befriend a real Clefairy on\n",
        "my own one day!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0488_T06R0301_00012",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received\n",
        "the lost Poké Doll!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0488_T06R0301_00013",
      "en_US": [
        "You watch. I’m going to get a\n",
        "real Clefairy as my friend."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0488_T06R0301_00014",
      "en_US": [
        "Look at my darling Skuntank!\r",
        "It’s so...\r",
        "...\r",
        "Ugh..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0488_T06R0301_00015",
      "en_US": [
        "It’s a Clefairy!\n",
        "Huh?\r",
        "Oh, right. It’s a Clefairy Poké Doll."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0488_T06R0301_00016",
      "en_US": "Skuntank: Skuuu!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0488_T06R0301_00017",
      "en_US": [
        "Let’s all listen politely to\n",
        "other Trainers."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0488_T06R0301_00018",
      "en_US": "If someone brags, brag right back!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0488_T06R0301_00019",
      "en_US": [
        "This Rapidash...\n",
        "It’s so precious... and...\r",
        "It’s...cute...lovely...smart...\n",
        "adorable...irresistible...plus...\f",
        "amazing...\r",
        "Oh, so...wild...beautiful...\n",
        "...kind...\r",
        "Want to hug it... Warm and cuddly...\n",
        "Oh, it’s...spectacular...captivating...\f",
        "simply divine..."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
